      "inspected": "Verified each of the three archives against deposit MD5 and byte count; all ZIP members CRC-tested. The three protocols contain 93 eight-column trial CSVs (pulling 30, tip 36, three-point 27) with 90 matching arrays in the supplied MAT files. Recomputed three two-channel load-cell module norms after exclusion of 63 flagged, initial threshold-exceeding rows.",
