      "inspected": "Verified the full ZIP and Table_1.pdf by published MD5 and size. CRC and numeric payload were checked for all 62 signals. Thirty pairs of X/Y measured traces have 61,000 values per axis; the X and Y reference lengths are 64,759 and 65,288. Compared measured vs commanded values over the common 61,000-index prefix for all 60 axis trials.",
